            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet 2.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye tekwaro pa Nua, Nua yam obedo dano ma kite atir, ma pe ki bal mo i kin yalwakke; Nua obedo ka wot kacel ki Lubaŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nua onoŋo tye ki awobene adek, Cem, Kam ki Yafeci.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lobo oballe woko ki i nyim Lubaŋa, onoŋo doŋ opoŋ ki bwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Lubaŋa oneno lobo, oneno oballe woko, pien dano ducu gutyeko balle woko i kit bedogi i wi lobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Lubaŋa owaco ki Nua ni, “Agik pa dano ducu doŋ obino i nyima, pien gupoŋo lobo woko ki bwami; nen, abityekogi woko, kacel ki lobo bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa yeya meri ki yat gofer; ci ipok kicika i yeya, ka imwon iye ki ŋeye ki odok.abic ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibitiyone kit man: yeya borre biromo yadi miya acel ki pyerabic,wiye abic, borre tuŋ malo yadi abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuc waŋ dirica i yeya, kun iweko danne malo doŋ futi acel ki nucu; ka iket doggola i but yeya, ci ipok iye obed kabedo adek, ma pinnye, me aryone ki me adekke ma malone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien nen, abicoro nii aluka madwoŋ i wi lobo, wek otyek kom gin ducu ma tye ki kwo, i te polo, wek gin ducu ma gitye i wi lobo oto woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento in aye abimoko gicikkena kwedi; ibidonyo i yeya, in kacel ki ‘litinoni, ki dakoni, ki mon pa awobeni ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwany gin makwo ducu ma gitye ki kom ki aryo aryo ki i kit kwagi acel acel, ci ipikgi i yeya, wek gubed kwo kacel ki in; gubed co ki mon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Winyo macalo kit kwagi tye, lee macalo kit kwagi tye, gin ma lak alaka i ŋom macalo kit kwagi tye, gin bibino boti ki aryo aryo ki i kit kwagi acel acel wek gubed kwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok iter kit kwa cam ducu ma gicamo, ci ikangi; wek gubed me acamagi bene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibru 11.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nua otimo kumeno; ocobo ducu macalo Lubaŋa ocike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
